		{"id":"b564c29b1f5943c7","type":"text","text":"### 多级放大电路","x":6265,"y":2708,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"b7556360b7c15150","type":"text","text":"#### 电源平均功率\n$$\nP_E =   V_{CC} \\times \\frac{1}{2\\pi} \\int_0^\\pi i_0 d(\\omega t)  $$\n\n$$= \\frac{V_{CC}}{2\\pi} \\int_0^\\pi \\frac{V_{om} \\sin \\omega t}{R_L} d(\\omega t) $$\n$$\n= \\frac{V_{CC}V_{om}}{\\pi R_L}\n$$","x":9210,"y":5325,"width":449,"height":316,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"73525399340dc57c","type":"text","text":"#### 输出效率\n$$\n\\eta_{\\max} = \\frac{P_{om}}{P_E} = \\frac{\\pi V_{om}}{2 V_{CC}} \\approx \\frac{\\pi}{4} \\approx 78.5\\%\n$$\n若考虑$V_{CES}$则在60%-70%左右","x":9210,"y":5666,"width":589,"height":208,"color":"4"},
