		{"id":"e228b0c2437cc013","type":"text","text":"#### 最大不失真功率\n$$\nP_{om} = V_{o} I_{o} = \\frac{V_{om}}{\\sqrt{2}} \\cdot \\frac{I_{om}}{\\sqrt{2}} = \\frac{V_{om}^2}{2R_L}\n$$","x":9210,"y":5934,"width":456,"height":180,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"23b4beb801716ad9","type":"text","text":"#### 电源平均功率\n$$\nP_E = 2 \\left[ V_{CC} \\times \\frac{1}{2\\pi} \\int_0^\\pi i_0 d(\\omega t) \\right] $$\n\n$$= \\frac{V_{CC}}{\\pi} \\int_0^\\pi \\frac{V_{om} \\sin \\omega t}{R_L} d(\\omega t) $$\n$$\n= \\frac{2V_{CC}V_{om}}{\\pi R_L}\n$$","x":9217,"y":6186,"width":449,"height":316,"color":"5"},
