		{"id":"3c8323482e5dcf9e","type":"text","text":"#### 输出效率\n\n\n$$\n\\eta_{\\max} = \\frac{P_{om}}{P_E} = \\frac{\\pi V_{om}}{4 V_{CC}} \\approx \\frac{\\pi}{4} \\approx 78.5\\%\n$$\n若考虑$V_{CES}$则在60%-70%左右","x":9217,"y":6529,"width":589,"height":222,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"649b64cdb84abde2","type":"text","text":"#### 管耗$P_T$\n$$\nP_T = P_E - P_{Om} = \\frac{2 V_{CC} V_{om}}{\\pi R_L} - \\frac{V_{om}^2}{2 R_L}\n$$\n求导可得\n$$\nP_{T1M} = P_{T2M} = \\frac{1}{2} P_{TM} \\approx 0.2 \\times \\frac{V_{CC}^2}{2 R_L}\n$$","x":9217,"y":6778,"width":449,"height":300,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"c4bb81649fe7cc99","type":"text","text":"### OTL的分析计算\n- $\\large V_{om}\\approx \\frac{V_{CC}}{2}$","x":8717,"y":5763,"width":293,"height":168},
		{"id":"832149b18aeffeb7","type":"text","text":"### OCL的分析计算\n- $\\large V_{om}\\approx V_{CC}$","x":8717,"y":6339,"width":289,"height":148},
